-names>DS</given-names></name><name><surname>Jopling</surname><given-names>WH</given-names></name><article-title>Classification of leprosy according to immunity &#x02013; a five-group system</article-title><source>Int J Lepr Other Mycobact Dis</source><year>1966</year><volume>34</volume><fpage>255</fpage><lpage>273</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">5950347</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B8"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Kaplan</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Nathan</surname><given-names>CF</given-names></name><name><surname>Gandhi</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Horwitz</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Levis</surname><given-names>WR</given-names></name><name><surname>Cohn</surname><given-names>ZA</given-names></name><article-title>Effect of recombinant interferon-g on hydrogen peroxide-releasing capacity of monocyte-derived macrophages from patients with lepromatous leprosy</article-title><source>J Immunol</source><year>1986</year><volume>137</volume><fpage>983</fpage><lpage>987</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3088117</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B9"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Wenzel</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Zahn</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Mikus</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Wiechert</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Bieber</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Tuting</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><article-title>The expression pattern of interferon-inducible proteins reflects the characteristic histological distribution of infiltrating immune cells in different cutaneous lupus erythematosus subsets</article-title><source>Br J Dermatol</source><year>2007</year><volume>157</volume><fpage>752</fpage><lpage>757</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1365-